#==============================================================================================
#
#   flex_formatting_context_1 - Layout::FlexFormattingContext: construction, the layout
#                               algorithm's driver, axes and the items' box model
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1-347) and the inline members of
#       FlexFormattingContext.h: the items' outer sizes, sizes resolved against the available
#       space, the constructor and the automatic content sizes, `run` (the flex layout
#       algorithm, https://www.w3.org/TR/css-flexbox-1/#layout-algorithm, step by step),
#       placing absolutely positioned children once the container is dimensioned, the main and
#       cross axes and their directions, and the margins, borders and padding of an item in
#       axis-agnostic terms.
